'''Nemona''' (Japanese: '''ネモ''' ''Nemo'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During this turn, attacks used by your {{TCGP|Pawmot}} do +80 damage to your opponent's Active {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}}.
}}

