==Trivia==
* A card named {{TCG|Nemona}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but with a different effect.
* This card affects {{p|Pawmot}}, which—along with its prevolutions—is frequently used by Nemona in the games in which she appears.

===Origin===
* [[Nemona]] is a [[rival]] character and a student at [[Naranja Academy]]{{sup/9|S}}/[[Uva Academy]]{{sup/9|V}}. She is depicted in her Uva Academy uniform.
* This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldean Fates|Nemona|82}} from the {{TCG|Paldean Fates}} expansion, originating from the Japanese {{TCG|Violet ex}} expansion.
* Nemona's house in [[Cabo Poco]] is featured in the standard illustration, while the private beach behind it is featured in the super rare card's illustration.

